1b (1b, missing "holds against"): fixed — R-16.f (ADV-3, ADV-4), R-23.f (ADV-2, ADV-1) and R-20.f (ADV-1) now exist; the adversary list itself stays a GP-0 proposal, as routed.

1c (1c, 6.4 met): no fix needed, unchanged.

1d (1d, render unverified): fixed — 11.6 records executed mmdc runs, exit 0, per-drawing SVG sizes.

1e (1e, 6.1): addressed — the header and 11.1 claim 6.1 met in form only; interview and sign-off stated pending.

1f (2a, unmarked re-casts): fixed — 6.1.h adds [C]/[H]/[A]/[P]; section 10 marks R-2, R-14, R-18, R-21, R-23, R-39 changed [P] with reason and source.

1g (2b, R-7): fixed — R-7.a restored unqualified; the same-host scope is [P] in R-7.e and "does not decide OD-1"; C-4 rewritten.

1h (2c, R-21): fixed — the missing-flag clause is [P] in R-21.a/e, sourced to AEF's adapter; the R-7.1 row is changed.

1i (2d, R-23): fixed — no-peer-content and claim-before-typing are [P] in R-23.a/e; the R-8.1 row is changed.

1j (2e, R-39): fixed — the checkout clause is [P] in R-39.a/e; the R-13.1 row is changed.

1k (2f, R-2/R-14/R-18): fixed — each carries [P] tags and a changed row in section 10.

1l (3a, neutrality fine): no fix needed, unchanged.

1m (3b, OD-18.d overreach, synthesized options, OD-1.d): fixed — OD-18.d now rests on RV2 items 43–45 and scopes item 71 correctly; OD-3.c.D and OD-4.c.D are marked collector-synthesized; OD-1.d remains transparently labelled.

1n (3c, R-7 pre-deciding OD-1): fixed — see 1g; the other provisional labels (D-2/D-3, OD-17.d "no acceptance by silence") hold.

